        "text": "structure ZeroOrderBounds (R detGap entryBound inverseLower zeta : ℝ) (H : Mat2) (T : Vec2) : Prop where determinant : detGap ≤ |(normalizedMatrix R H).det|; entries : ∀ i j, |R * H i j| ≤ entryBound; weights : ∀ j, inverseLower * R * zeta ≤ SmoothCovariance.weights H T j"
